    std::vector<int> variables = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
    std::transform(variables.begin(), variables.end(), variables.begin(), processVariable);
    // Now, variables contains {2, 4, 6, 8, 10}
    return 0;
}
```

This approach allows you to run the same code inline on multiple named variables in a concise and readable manner.

